  "description": "Version\u202f1.0 of the geometry dataset is stored under **/data/geometries**. It contains a single geometry object identified as **geom1**; the associated file is marked as OK and can be accessed at **/geom/geom1**.\n\nThe geometry defines two sequential directions. The first, **dir1**, is oriented to the north on **Main\u202fSt**, allows two exit lanes, has a speed limit of\u202f45\u202fmph, spans 120\u202fm, and leads to the next direction, **dir2**. Traffic movements for **dir1** include a straight-through movement (ST) using one lane, phase\u202f0, overlap code\u202fA, permitted once, displayed as an arrow; and a left\u2011turn movement (LT) also on one lane, phase\u202f1, overlap code\u202fB, not permitted, displayed as a standard left turn sign. The second direction, **dir2**, points east on **Second\u202fSt**, provides a single exit lane, a speed limit of\u202f30\u202fmph, covers 80\u202fm, and points to the next segment **dir3**. For **dir2**, the only defined movement is a right\u2011turn (RT) on one lane, phase\u202f0, overlap code\u202fC, permitted, shown with a ball indicator."
